\pard\sa120\sb120\fs28\b Description\b0{\*\bkmkstart description}{\*\bkmkend description}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Creates a deterministic UUID (GUID) by computing SHA-256 hash of the server name combined with a timestamp. The first 16 bytes of the hash are converted to a standard UUID format. This ensures the same server and timestamp always produce the same UUID.\par
